{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログ間違えてましたね...\n失礼しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/03/8310084/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日今日からオンエアされる\n『ここさけ』の新CM"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの中田が映ってて泣きそう(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/LOs2VHTmzJ4"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"既に泣いてた～(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ブログに書いたけど、\n本当に素敵な作品です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだの方は是非観てみてほしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/03/8310084/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のブログを振り返ってみますと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーユニット に\n乃木ぷぷ に\nPanasonic充電池 に\n『隙間』 に\nここさけCM"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い怖すぎる...\nなんでだ...\n何があった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月はアンダーユニットなどで\n様々な雑誌に登場しますので\n随時告知させてもらいますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/03/8310084/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはよくわかってると思うけど\nこんな機会なかなか無いから\n中田推しは全部チェックしてください＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n明日はユニットメンバーで\nらじらー！に出させてもらいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大人への近道』解禁ですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、ユニット名決定の瞬間も\n聴いててください！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/03/8310084/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/03/8310084/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHKラジオ『らじらー！SUNDAY』\n10/4(日)20:05～23:00"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニット名\nメッセージ、質問\nアンダーライブ勝手に大予想などなど\n送ってくださいね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/03/8310084/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}